WEBVTT

video-title-observation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Okutunuulira n'okukebera nga kizimbulukuse

observation-01
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.700
Kebera amaaso, ebikowe n'okwetooloola. Noonya ekitali kya bulijjo.

observation-02
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Ddamu okebere ng'ozimbulukusa. Teeka ekitangaala kya Arclight ku maanyi agasinga.

observation-03
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Ekyuma ku liiso lyo. Semberera erya ddyo ery'omulwadde mpola okulaba obulungi.

observation-04
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Mugambe atunuule ku ddyo, ate ku kkono.

observation-05
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.800
Kwata ebikowe mpola, omugambe atunuule waggulu ne wansi. Kebera ebitundu by'olaba mu bibinja.

structures-01
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Ekisooka: obukoowekoowe n'empenda z'ebikowe byombi.

structures-02
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.450
Ekyokubiri: conjunctiva ne sclera,

structures-03
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.100
n'ensawo eya wansi.

structures-04
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.900
Ekyokusatu: cornea,

structures-05
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.400
n'egattiro lyayo ne sclera, limbus,

structures-06
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.700
n'emmunye eyeetooloddwa iris.

conditions-01
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Bino bifaananyi by'endwadde ez'enjawulo. Kebera mpola ne Arclight.

video-title-chamber-depth
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:45.800
Obuziba bw'ekisenge eky'omu maaso

chamber-depth-01
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.850
Ekisenge eky'omu maaso kiri wakati wa cornea ne iris.

chamber-depth-02
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.000
Yaka okuva ku ludda lw'okutu okukebera obuziba bw'ekisenge eky'omu maaso.

chamber-depth-03
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.100
Ekisiikirize ku nnyindo: obuziba buyinza obutamala. Sindika.

video-title-fluorescein
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.100
Okusiiga cornea ne fluorescein

fluorescein-application
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.600
Teekamu fluorescein n'akakonge oba ettodde lya Minims.

fluorescein-01
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.000
Kebera cornea n'ekitangaala kya bbululu.

fluorescein-02
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.500
Awavudde olususu olw'okungulu n'awalwadde wajja kweyoleka. Wandiika ekifo n'obunene.

video-title-lid-eversion
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:30.367
Okukyusa ekikowe ekya waggulu

lid-eversion-grip
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.700
Kwata mpola obukoowekoowe bwa waggulu n'ensajja n'esonga.

lid-eversion-01
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:42.200
Teeka akati ka ppamba ku kikowe waggulu. Kakyesigamize okukikyusa.

lid-eversion-02
00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:47.700
Kikuume nga kikyuse, osooke okebere munda n'eriiso lyokka.

lid-eversion-03
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.400
Sembereza Arclight okuzimbulukusa.
